  "postText": "<p><HTML><HEAD><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\"></HEAD><body></p>\n<div align=\"center\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/161/08e1cb1b473fe20817c2c6d1c50c180d..jpg\"></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ニコ生見てくれてありがつ～！！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">たのしかった！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">やっぱり配信たのしー</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">昔からずっと喋るの好きなんですよね</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">自撮りだけだと静かだと思われがちですが</div>\n<div align=\"center\">（なんでー）</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">意外とこういう女です。</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">気軽に接してね♪</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">秋葉原のお屋敷にこれない方も</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">配信通して仲良くなれたら嬉しい！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">これからも配信やるねー！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">またみてね</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ありまと♪</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/161/dfb79a9c15fd4c3e7272533aa200e3a0..jpg\"></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<p></body></HTML></p>\n",
